        "text": " beautiful, modern UI running flawlessly in your virtual machine. You just built the interface of a next-generation simulator in a matter of minutes"
      }, {
        "text": ".\n\nNow, we move to **Phase 2: The Emulation Pipeline**. \nIt is time to give"
      }, {
        "text": " this software a brain. We are going to connect that `RUN` button so it takes your C++ code, compiles it into AVR"
