      }, {
        "text": " heavy C++ compilers on your machine).\n2. We will use **AVR8js** to create a virtual"
      }, {
        "text": " Arduino CPU in your browser.\n3. Every time you press `RUN`, we will destroy the old CPU and spawn a"
      }, {
        "text": " completely new one. **Zero memory leaks. 100% deterministic.**\n\n### Step 1: Install the Emulator"
      }, {
        "text": " Engine\nKeep your server running, just open a new terminal window (or stop it with `Ctrl+C`, run the"
      }, {
        "text": " command, and restart it).\n\nRun this command to install the AVR physics/emulator engine:\n```bash\nnpm install avr8"
      }, {
        "text": "js\n```\n\n### Step 2: The Core Logic\nOpen your `src/App.jsx`. We are going to replace the"
      }, {
