        "text": "\n    if (line[0] \u003d\u003d\u003d \u0027:\u0027 \u0026\u0026 line.substring(7, 9) \u003d\u003d\u003d \u002700"
      }, {
        "text": "\u0027) {\n      const bytes \u003d parseInt(line.substring(1, 3), 16);"
      }, {
        "text": "\n      const addr \u003d parseInt(line.substring(3, 7), 16);\n      for (let i"
