        "text": "\n      \n    } catch (err) {\n      setSysLogs(prev \u003d\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "[...prev, \u0027\u003e NETWORK/SYSTEM ERROR: \u0027 + err.message]);\n      setIsRunning(false);\n    }\n  };"
      }, {
