        "text": " a subtle, devastating bug, and now we have to go through the scientific process"
      }, {
        "text": " to figure out why.\n\n### Step 1: Verify the UI\n\nThe UI should be showing the robot\u0027s state.\n\n*   Are the \""
      }, {
        "text": "Motor Left\" and \"Motor Right\" pins turning green in the Workshop panel when the code is running?\n\n### Step 2: Add Logging\n\nBecause the `"
