      }, {
        "text": " a problem at all. You are doing excellent work.\n\nI know exactly why"
      }, {
        "text": " the whole UI went blank again. \n\n### The Strict Mode Conflict (Rem"
      }, {
        "text": "atch!)\nThe new `react-resizable-panels` library must trigger a bug inside the strict mode. React\u0027s double-rendering system doesn\u0027t work well"
      }, {
        "text": " with certain layout tools that expect to calculate sizes only once. \n\n### The Simple Fix (and UI Polish)\nOpen `src/index.jsx`. We"
      }],
