      }, {
        "text": " default App;\n```\n\n### Try it!\n1. **The Auto-Save Test:** Change the size of your windows."
      }, {
        "text": " Drag the robot to the bottom corner. Press **F5 to refresh the page**. The entire setup—the windows AND the robot\u0027"
      }, {
        "text": "s position—will load *exactly* where you left it!\n2. **The \"Reset\" Protocol:** Press"
      }, {
        "text": " RUN to let the robot drive away. While it\u0027s moving, press STOP, then **RESET**. It won\u0027t snap"
      }, {
        "text": " back to 200x200; it will snap back to *your custom saved starting point*!\n3. **"
      }, {
        "text": "The File System:** Look at the top of the \"Robot Workshop\" panel. Click `Export Config`. It will download a file named `fl"
      }, {
        "text": "awless_layout.json`. You can share this file with anyone, and they can click `Import Config` to instantly"
      }, {
        "text": " snap their UI into your custom layout!"
