      }, {
        "text": "\nThere is now a slick **`Run Local .HEX`** button right at the top of the Code Editor."
      }, {
        "text": " \n\nIf you compile your code in the official Arduino IDE, just click that button and select your compiled `.hex` file."
      }, {
        "text": " The simulator will completely ignore the cloud compiler and the code editor, inject your local machine code directly into the virtual CPU, and execute it flawlessly"
      }, {
        "text": " offline!"
      }, {
