        "text": " catch (e) { console.error(\"Config load error\", e); }\n  return DEFAULT_CONFIG;\n};\n\nconst defaultCode \u003d `// HARDWARE PINS\nconst int MOTOR_LEFT \u003d 9;  // Port B,"
