      "createTime": "2026-04-29T06:31:18.979Z"
    }, {
      "text": "Those two things fell to the bottom; bring them back to the top. Then, attach SYS_TELEMETRY and MANUAL POSE to each one separately; don\u0027t combine them. Leave only ROBOT POSITION.",
      "role": "user",
