        "text": " to cram too much information into one box, and you\u0027ve spotted the perfect way to clean it up.\n\nBy separating the telemetry and manual pose, and only showing \"ROBOT POSITION\" (which is actually the X, Y, and"
      }, {
        "text": " Angle), we make the UI much more intuitive and professional.\n\n### The Ultimate HUD Cleanup\n\nOpen `src/App.jsx`, select all, delete, and paste this final version. *(Notice how the Telemetry and Manual Pose are"
      }, {
        "text": " now in their own distinct boxes within the Robot Workshop panel)*\n\n```jsx\nimport React, { useState, useRef, useEffect } from \u0027react\u0027;\nimport Editor from \u0027@monaco-editor/react\u0027;\nimport { Play, Square, Rotate"
