        "text": " \u0026\u0026 pin \u003c\u003d 7) {\n    portAddr \u003d 0x2B; bit \u003d pin;"
      }, {
        "text": "\n  } else if (pin \u003e\u003d 8 \u0026\u0026 pin \u003c\u003d 13) {\n    portAddr \u003d 0x"
