      }, {
        "text": " broken it). Now, it intelligently handles the text strings for custom names, and places a slick `[WHEEL]"
      }, {
        "text": "` or `[SONAR]` tag right next to the glowing status light.\n\n### The Workshop Polish Update\nOpen `src/App."
