        "text": " size\u003d{14} /\u003e RESET\n            \u003c/button\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n```\n\nUpload your custom `.hex` file. You will see a beautiful"
      }, {
